WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.620
Ghouls Attack
Red-Eyes B. Dragon Targeted

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.070
Battle City?

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:37.010
Domino City is going to have a lavish Duel Monsters tournament?

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:37.900
Yeah.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.450
Lots of tough duelists are already here.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.450
That punk Kaiba!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:47.370
I finished second in Duelist Kingdom, but he didn't tell me?

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.190
Unforgivable!

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.690
Jonouchi, you're planning to enter?

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.570
Of course, Honda!

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:56.130
But Shizuka's surgery is tomorrow.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.310
I'll be there for that.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.760
But I'll make it in time if I leave quickly afterwards.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.240
Yugi, you're participating, right?

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.500
Of course!

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:11.580
But Battle City uses the ante rule, so I can't afford to lose.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:14.360
Ante?  What's that?

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.100
You bet a card.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.250
Bet a card?

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:22.950
Yeah.  The winner gets one rare card from the loser.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.920
What?  Rare card?

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:30.390
If I lose a duel, I lose this?

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:32.340
You sure you wanna enter?

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.540
That card is your entire fortune.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.900
Whatever!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:43.570
Don't worry.  Red-Eyes is my goddess of victory.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:49.180
We're tied together by an unbreakable red string of destiny.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.120
All I have to do is keep winning.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:55.240
Then I'll get lots of rare cards!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.680
If you get greedy, you'll get in trouble.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:03.800
Oh, there's one more thing you need to enter the tournament.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.540
What is it?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.400
The new Duel Disk.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:12.120
Kaiba invented a new new virtual card battle machine.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.780
A new Duel Disk?

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.240
That reminds me...

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.800
Damn!

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:23.660
Jonouchi, you look good on your hands and knees.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.690
You can't even stand up, you loser.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.120
I've only had bad experiences with Duel Disks.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:36.320
My store doesn't carry it, but other card shops do.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.680
Then let's go get one!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:46.740
The store should be around here.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.560
Isn't it around the corner?

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.900
Great!  Let's get it now!

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.500
Anzu, you know the store?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.400
I went there with the other Yugi yesterday.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.690
I see.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.000
Anzu, thanks for yesterday.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.200
My other self has cheered up.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.340
Did you talk with your other self?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.820
Yeah.  About Battle City.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:14.810
I see...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:20.520
He didn't tell him about the tablet or Ishizu.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.310
But something is weird.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:29.050
My other self never uses the ante rule.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:34.400
He says that a real rare card isn't rare because it's scarce.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:40.870
Out of the thousands of cards, the forty cards you choose are rare because they're irreplaceable.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:43.930
That's why he won't bet his cards.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.640
But now...

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:51.320
I feel like my other self wants something else.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.770
Here's the place!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.770
They have a lot of stuff!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.820
Check it out, Honda!

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:59.640
Wow!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:05.220
Yugi will soon find out what the other Yugi wants.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.640
They're too close to hide anything from each other.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.970
We're coming in!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.120
Let's see.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.880
Welcome.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:17.360
Do you have the new Duel Disk?

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.880
You must be duelists who are entering the tournament.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.410
I've had quite a few customers like you.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:27.760
What's your name?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.660
Yugi Muto.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.910
Yugi Muto...

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.880
There you are.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.880
You're all good.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.250
What do you mean?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:45.480
Kaiba Corporation sent me information on duelists throughout the country.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:49.000
Such as duelist level and number of rare cards.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:56.780
If you're at least level 5, I must give you a Duel Disk for free because you've qualified for the tournament.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.220
Kaiba said that?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.350
I see.  That's how he's selecting the participants.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:07.700
Yugi, your duelist level is 8, which is the maximum.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:09.970
Congratulations.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.510
This is yours.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.680
Thank you.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.120
Mister, I'm Katsuya Jonouchi!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.570
Jonouchi...

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.760
You're a level 2 nobody.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.000
Why is he calling you a nobody?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.430
What?  A nobody?

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.080
Kaiba, you punk!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.760
Calm down!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.870
I'm no nobody!

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.540
That means...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.980
Since you're level 2, you're disqualified.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:45.170
Why is the runner-up at Duelist Kingdom disqualified?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.290
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.500
He has a rare card this powerful?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.060
I won't accept it!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.660
Jonouchi...

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:02.090
Oh my, it was a computer error.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.530
You're actually level 5.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.470
You've qualified.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.560
It's true!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.340
Phew.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:19.000
Okay then.  I'll accept the Duel Disk.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.380
Here you go.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:21.680
It's mine!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.610
Hooray!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.620
Good for you, Jonouchi.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:27.920
Bye bye.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.760
Come back again!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:38.130
It's me.  I found our first prey.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.800
It's getting late.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:45.810
Sorry, but I have to go to the hospital.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.860
I hope Shizuka's surgery goes well.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.680
Thanks.  See ya!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.620
Bye bye!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:58.620
It's finally time.  I bet Jonouchi feels conflicted.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.190
His mom will be at the hospital.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:08.560
When he was little, his mom took his sister and left.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.160
I see.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:14.340
If he goes to the surgery, he'll definitely meet his mom.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.900
Then I'll be the one to bring the family back together tomorrow!

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.370
You're strangely proactive.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.710
That's because Shizuka is Honda's type.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.840
I was reading the Duel Disk's manual and lost track of time.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.370
Just wait, Shizuka.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.380
What's with you?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.070
I'm in a hurry!

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.510
So you're Katsuya Jonouchi.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.370
How do you know my name?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:58.180
We, the Ghouls, will not let you pass.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:08:59.620
Ghouls?

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.220
I read about them in the newspaper.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:08.420
They're a group of thieves who challenge duelists all over the world and steal their rare cards.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:13.530
Katsuya Jonouchi, I challenge you to a duel!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.500
So you won't let me escape.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:20.980
Listen up.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.280
We'll play under Battle City rules!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.820
And the ante rule.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.940
If you lose, I get your Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.770
I don't have time for this!

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:33.850
I have no choice.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.350
Don't cry after we're done!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:43.790
Duel!

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.600
Shizuka, calm down.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:55.980
I get nervous when I think about the surgery.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:01.510
And my brother just called saying that he's coming here.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.230
Katsuya?

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.060
My turn!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.990
I summon Panther Warrior in attack position!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.230
My turn.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.170
I set a monster in defense position.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.540
I'll finish you quickly.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.820
My card is Scapegoat!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:39.440
It brings out four monsters simultaneously.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:45.000
I tribute one so that Panther Warrior can attack!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.720
What's wrong?

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:58.300
Come at me!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:10:59.890
My turn.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:07.680
Graceful Charity lets me draw three cards and discard two.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.350
Then I set a monster in defense position.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.850
What's with him?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:17.120
He challenged me, but he's only playing defense.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:42.140
Big brother, hurry up and come!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:49.890
I don't know why you're only defending, but I won't show you any mercy!

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.450
Alligator's Sword!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.240
I tribute another Scapegoat!

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.280
Panther Warrior attacks the set card!

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:11.020
Nice!  He has no monsters to defend with!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:16.430
The Battle City rules allow me to attack the player directly.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.710
Go, Alligator's Sword!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.620
Attack him directly!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.190
How's that!

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:29.420
My turn.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:30.810
Graceful Charity.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.590
What?

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:37.360
Its effect lets me draw three cards and discard two.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.210
Then I set a monster in defense position.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.240
The same move again?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.080
Oh, I get it!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:52.080
I thought you were up to something, but you're actually just weak!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:56.520
You can only defend because I'm too strong!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.040
I'll bring this to an end.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:08.620
Umm...  Under the new rules, I think I need to tribute to summon a Level 7 monster.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:16.170
I'm not allowed to tribute Scapegoats to summon, but I have Panther Warrior and Alligator's Sword.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:21.550
Forget it!  Take all the tributes you need!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.800
I summon Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:39.100
I see.  Level 7 monsters require two tributes.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.330
Here I go!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.510
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.850
Black Fireball!

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.270
How do you like the power of my Red-Eyes?

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:58.210
I know you want this card, but you can't have it.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:01.770
Just remember how it looks!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.640
I'll end you next turn!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.150
What's so funny?

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:11.500
You don't have a next turn!

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:12.510
What?

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.220
I draw my card.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.680
You were unlucky to run into me.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.270
Come, Exodia!

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.210
What?  Exodia?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.690
No way!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.730
Someone other than Yugi has Exodia cards?

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:56.070
It's true that Exodia parts are rare cards that you can't normally acquire.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:15:00.470
But my deck has three copies of each part!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:06.120
Ghouls can duplicate rare cards!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.500
That's not fair!

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.510
Winning is everything.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.780
We'll do whatever it takes to win.

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:13.590
What?

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:15.370
You punks!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:16.800
Dammit!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.540
I'm taking your Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.180
Red-Eyes...

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.810
Open the door, Shizuka!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.900
Shizuka, let me in!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.340
Shizuka, please!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:49.520
No!  I won't have my surgery until my brother gets here!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.740
Hello?

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:52.960
Jonouchi's mom?

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:57.360
What?  Jonouchi isn't at the hospital?

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.960
But he was going there last night!

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:03.860
Yugi!

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.120
Anzu!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.420
Honda!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.400
Yugi, is it true that Jonouchi is missing?

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.300
What's that idiot doing?

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.480
Honda, where'd you get that motorcycle?

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:21.300
I borrowed it from a friend.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.320
It'll let me search the city quicker.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:28.730
But there's no way Jonouchi wouldn't go to Shizuka's hospital!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.070
Do you think something happened to him?

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:36.920
The surgeon has to leave for America tonight for another operation.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:40.070
He has to start the surgery by noon!

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:41.300
We don't have much time!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:43.480
Let's split up and find him!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.660
Jonouchi!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.220
Jonouchi...

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.420
Answer if you hear me!

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.330
Is he really gone?

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:10.330
Sorry, Shizuka.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:17.170
Shame on you, Jonouchi!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.070
Honda?  What's wrong?

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:25.820
What's wrong?  What are you doing here?

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.960
I thought you were going to the hospital!

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:37.110
Jonouchi, what happened?

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:42.260
On the way to the hospital yesterday, the Ghouls showed up and...

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.200
Ghouls?

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:47.260
They hunt rare cards illegally.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:51.140
I lost the match, and they took my Red-Eyes.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:52.140
What?

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:57.080
Jonouchi, it's just one card.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.750
You have to get to the hospital.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:04.990
Be quiet!  Red-Eyes is a precious card that helped me win!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.690
And I lost it...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:12.980
Listen up!  Since you didn't go to the hospital, Shizuka doesn't want to have her surgery!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:18.640
She doesn't have the courage because you're not there to encourage her!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.100
Shizuka...

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.580
The way I am right now, I won't be able to encourage her.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:34.520
I like watching you and Yugi duel.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:39.590
Because I can see your bonds get stronger through those cards.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:48.470
But you're going to lose your bond with your sister because of those cards?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:03.040
We're out of time!

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.460
Wasn't that...

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.120
Honda and Jonouchi!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.560
Shizuka, please open the door!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:18.240
I'm sorry, but we're out of time.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.240
Doctor!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.160
Wait!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.870
Katsuya...

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:29.310
Mom, let me talk to her.

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.900
Shizuka...

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.250
Shizuka, aren't you going to have the surgery?

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.620
Open the door.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.190
No!  You're a liar!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.470
Why didn't you visit me?

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:44.510
Why weren't you by my side?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.980
I was so scared...

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:53.800
I'm sorry.  I ran into trouble on the way here yesterday.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:59.740
I blanked out, and all I could think about was myself.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.170
I'm pathetic.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.420
But my friends helped me.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:09.860
They searched for me and told me how you were doing.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:15.420
They taught me that even when I'm going through hard times...

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:20.870
...I can't forget about those who worry about me and need me.

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:24.840
The most important thing is the bond between people.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.540
I'm sorry, Shizuka.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.880
I almost forgot about that.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:33.000
But I don't want you to forget.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.940
Mom and I are always with you.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:41.600
Shizuka.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.380
Big brother!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.480
Shizuka!

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.320
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.260
Thank you, Katsuya.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.930
The surgery was a success?

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.860
Hooray!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.000
Thanks, Yugi.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.550
Jonouchi, I heard what happened.

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:06.810
Yugi, Battle City is very dangerous.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:09.000
Be careful.  They're...

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.800
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.480
It's nothing.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.560
I'll see you at Battle City.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.050
Yup!  Later!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.340
What are the Ghouls like?

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:27.000
Yugi, I won't mope around anymore.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.280
I'll get my Red-Eyes back on my own!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:42.880
Battle City is about to begin!

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:49.720
Due to Kaiba's big announcement, duelists have gathered in Domino City and are ready to battle!

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:56.000
What?  Battle City's first match is Yugi vs the Rare Hunter who stole Jonouchi's Red-Eyes?

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:57.730
Do your best, Yugi!

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:01.370
Get Jonouchi's revenge and take back Red-Eyes!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.460
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Fierce Battle!  Battle City Begins

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.970
Duel, standby!

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:25.360
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:30.730
I feel like I've been here

00:22:31.270 --> 00:22:40.410
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:51.920
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:59.430
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:04.700
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:05.270 --> 00:23:09.810
Will never change

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:15.080
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:20.280
To be who I am

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:25.520
I've kept searching for something

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:30.230
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:33.160
I learned that's the answer

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:40.270
From now until forever...
